<div class="bb-quote"><b>Cult of Gloom wrote:</b><br /><blockquote class="bb-quote-body">I actually really dislike this game. I backed it mainly to support Handlabra and because it had Fanatic as a stretch goal and she is one of my favorite characters, but after a few runs though the dungeon I kind of wish I had not.
